    "file" : "review-agent/src/main/kotlin/dev/abhinav/reviewagent/Main.kt",
    "line" : 88,
    "severity" : "minor",
    "title" : "The trace is lost if fetching the full diff fails after the review is submitted",
    "what_goes_wrong" : "The model submits a review, then the step that re-downloads the PR diff to check the findings fails. For example, `gh` is not logged in, the network drops, or `gh` is missing. That step throws an error from `fetchFullDiff`, which runs before the trace and run record are written. The program crashes and neither file is saved.",
    "why_it_matters" : "This PR is meant to keep a trace even when a run goes wrong. Here a full, paid model run that did finish is thrown away, and nothing is left to debug from.",
    "how_to_fix" : "Write the trace file right after `agent.run` returns, before the validation step. Or wrap the diff fetch and validation in `runCatching` and save the error in the run record, so both files are always written."
  } ]
